00:38:16.540 --> 00:38:18.280
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: Yes, in 2024...

asr-000486
00:38:18.860 --> 00:38:23.060
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: Yung unused was, you're correct, 10 billion.

asr-000487
00:38:23.060 --> 00:38:30.500
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: Of the 10 billion, 4.2 yung kinatawag na unobligated allotment.

asr-000488
00:38:30.800 --> 00:38:34.580
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: So carried over to the following year because of the two-year validity.

asr-000489
00:38:35.520 --> 00:38:39.920
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: And then meron hung part dyan, tinatawag na unreleased appropriation.

asr-000490
00:38:40.520 --> 00:38:48.720
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: And itong unreleased appropriation, these are the expenses na subject to special allotment release.

asr-000493
00:38:49.100 --> 00:38:50.020
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: Tinatawag na SARO.

asr-000494
00:38:50.020 --> 00:38:54.140
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: And mainly it's for the e-passport budget.

asr-000495
00:38:55.060 --> 00:39:00.000
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: Now, again, because hindi ho nagagamit in full yung passports,

asr-000496
00:39:00.820 --> 00:39:05.120
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: part of it nasasoli kung mag-expire na,

asr-000497
00:39:05.560 --> 00:39:08.080
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: and part of it nagiging continuing appropriations.

asr-000498
00:39:08.520 --> 00:39:17.540
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: Again, it's because of the projections that were made way back in 2015 for the 10-year MICA.

asr-000499
00:39:17.540 --> 00:39:18.540
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: Medyo sumobra.

asr-000500
00:39:18.860 --> 00:39:25.800
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: But for the later years, so only part of the passport budget ang nagagamit.

asr-000501
00:39:25.940 --> 00:39:30.260
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: So big chunk, nagiging unused appropriations.

asr-000502
00:39:30.500 --> 00:39:36.080
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So the 6.3 billion na hindi po naibigay ng BBM, ano ito? Part of what is this?

asr-000503
00:39:36.560 --> 00:39:41.440
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: 6 billion, ito ho yung for the passports, for the passport budget.

asr-000504
00:39:43.440 --> 00:39:48.160
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: And the small part, tinatawag ko na international commitments fund.

asr-000505
00:39:48.860 --> 00:39:50.760
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: It's in the amount of 50 million.

asr-000506
00:39:51.100 --> 00:39:55.680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: If it isn't released, don't you call DBM and say we need it?

asr-000507
00:39:56.060 --> 00:39:57.800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Or you do?

asr-000508
00:39:58.260 --> 00:40:07.020
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: If it isn't released, if it's going to be part of continuing appropriations,

asr-000509
00:40:07.160 --> 00:40:08.700
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: magagamit ho yan the following year.

asr-000510
00:40:08.960 --> 00:40:11.460
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: So they keep it intact for the needs.

asr-000511
00:40:11.460 --> 00:40:14.900
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Let me just go to the Department of Budget and Management.

asr-000512
00:40:15.180 --> 00:40:18.620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Maybe Ms. Aguilar or Ms. Dizon,

asr-000513
00:40:18.860 --> 00:40:19.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: can you answer this?

asr-000514
00:40:19.920 --> 00:40:25.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano po nangyari, ma'am, at hindi po na-release yung 6.3 billion appropriations

asr-000515
00:40:25.120 --> 00:40:26.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: para sa DFA o SEC?

asr-000516
00:40:27.300 --> 00:40:31.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Anong dahilan o basis ng non-release ng mga pondong ito?

asr-000517
00:40:31.240 --> 00:40:34.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kaya minsan, hindi lang po ito first time ko narinig.

asr-000518
00:40:34.720 --> 00:40:38.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Narinig ko sa other agencies, kahit previous budget,

asr-000519
00:40:39.500 --> 00:40:41.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ang hindi na-release ng DBM.

asr-000520
00:40:41.380 --> 00:40:46.000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano po mga reasons po ba na hindi po agad na-release ng DBM?

asr-000521
00:40:46.520 --> 00:40:47.800
DBM OIC Director III Mary Rose P. Aguilar: Yes po, good afternoon.

asr-000522
00:40:48.860 --> 00:40:51.320
DBM OIC Director III Mary Rose P. Aguilar: In the case po kasi ng DFA,

asr-000523
00:40:51.540 --> 00:40:56.900
DBM OIC Director III Mary Rose P. Aguilar: ang bulk po ng mga unrelease APRO nila is pertaining po dun sa e-passport

asr-000524
00:40:56.900 --> 00:41:01.740
DBM OIC Director III Mary Rose P. Aguilar: which is subject po to the submission of special budget request.

asr-000525
00:41:01.920 --> 00:41:03.860
DBM OIC Director III Mary Rose P. Aguilar: Ang nangyari po kasi sa DFA,

asr-000526
00:41:04.020 --> 00:41:09.740
DBM OIC Director III Mary Rose P. Aguilar: because of hindi po nila nagagamit yung current provision nila for the e-passport

asr-000527
00:41:09.740 --> 00:41:11.740
DBM OIC Director III Mary Rose P. Aguilar: and nagkakaroon po ng continuing,

asr-000528
00:41:11.960 --> 00:41:14.860
DBM OIC Director III Mary Rose P. Aguilar: so nagkakaroon po siya ng spillover the following year.

asr-000529
00:41:14.860 --> 00:41:17.860
DBM OIC Director III Mary Rose P. Aguilar: So ang nare-release lang po for the DFA,

asr-000530
00:41:18.860 --> 00:41:22.340
DBM OIC Director III Mary Rose P. Aguilar: i-request po nila is yung continuing appropriation.

asr-000531
00:41:22.520 --> 00:41:25.580
DBM OIC Director III Mary Rose P. Aguilar: So ang nangyayari po, lumalaki po yung unrelease APRO nila

asr-000532
00:41:25.580 --> 00:41:29.920
DBM OIC Director III Mary Rose P. Aguilar: kasi hindi po nila nagagamit yung current appropriations.

asr-000533
00:41:32.740 --> 00:41:37.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I don't know if the good secretary can answer this or ask Si Fernandez.

asr-000534
00:41:38.120 --> 00:41:44.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Magkano na po ang overall disbursement rate ng DFA as of August 31, 2026 this year?

asr-000535
00:41:44.900 --> 00:41:47.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi dito po as of June,

asr-000536
00:41:47.140 --> 00:41:51.000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: may 23 billion pa po kayo na unused appropriations

asr-000537
00:41:51.000 --> 00:41:54.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: of the 28.3 billion po sa gaan ninyo.

asr-000538
00:41:55.680 --> 00:41:59.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: That was June, pero siyempre on August po, I'm asking for August 31.

asr-000539
00:42:29.100 --> 00:42:33.100
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: Your Honor, as of the end of August,

asr-000540
00:42:33.200 --> 00:42:35.600
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: our BURs in the neighborhood are 55%.

asr-000541
00:42:37.680 --> 00:42:40.900
Senator Erwin Tulfo: In big year, sir, that will be 55%.

asr-000542
00:42:41.220 --> 00:42:43.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Out of the 28.3, that will be around what?

asr-000543
00:42:44.840 --> 00:42:46.680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: About 14?

asr-000544
00:42:47.140 --> 00:42:50.520
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ah, billion na ang nagagastos ninyo?

asr-000545
00:42:53.600 --> 00:42:57.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mga 15 na lang natitira or 13 billion na lang natitira?

asr-000546
00:42:57.140 --> 00:42:59.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: If you're saying 55%?

asr-000547
00:43:03.080 --> 00:43:05.320
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: Your Honor, 17.5 billion.

asr-000548
00:43:05.320 --> 00:43:07.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: 17.5 billion ang natitira?

asr-000549
00:43:07.840 --> 00:43:08.580
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: Ang nagamit.

asr-000550
00:43:09.240 --> 00:43:09.740
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ang nagamit.

asr-000551
00:43:09.740 --> 00:43:11.200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ang na-appropriate?

asr-000552
00:43:11.200 --> 00:43:12.360
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: Yes, ang na-obligato.

asr-000553
00:43:12.360 --> 00:43:13.900
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: 17.5 billion.

asr-000554
00:43:13.900 --> 00:43:16.760
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Alright, moving to another issue.

asr-000555
00:43:17.140 --> 00:43:20.460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ito po ang 1.6 billion in budgetary adjustments.

asr-000556
00:43:20.780 --> 00:43:22.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: May mga transfer po kayong ginawa.

asr-000557
00:43:24.440 --> 00:43:27.540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Miscellaneous personal benefits funds, 1.5B.

asr-000558
00:43:28.120 --> 00:43:31.160
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pension and gratuity funds, 77 million.

asr-000559
00:43:32.160 --> 00:43:34.900
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Contingent fund, 26.1 million.

asr-000560
00:43:35.660 --> 00:43:37.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mababa po ang utilization rate,

asr-000561
00:43:37.600 --> 00:43:40.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: pero kinakailangan ninyo maglipat ng pondo.

asr-000562
00:43:40.800 --> 00:43:43.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Saan po ba ginagamit ang budgetary adjustments?

asr-000563
00:43:45.060 --> 00:43:45.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ...

asr-000566
00:43:52.860 --> 00:44:01.780
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000568
00:44:02.100 --> 00:44:03.760
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: Usually, itong mga budgetary

asr-000569
00:44:03.760 --> 00:44:05.560
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: adjustments, these are the additional

asr-000570
00:44:05.560 --> 00:44:07.780
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: requirements for personal

asr-000571
00:44:07.780 --> 00:44:09.640
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: services, usually at post

asr-000572
00:44:09.640 --> 00:44:12.830
DFA Assistant Secretary Emilio T. Fernandez: na nire-request ko sa DBM.

asr-000573
00:44:12.830 --> 00:44:13.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yes, yes.

asr-000574
00:44:14.340 --> 00:44:14.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Alright.

asr-000577
00:44:17.140 --> 00:44:25.660
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Isa pa hong nakikita natin, legal assistance po, under din po ito sa OSEC, di po ba?

asr-000578
00:44:26.840 --> 00:44:27.960
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000579
00:44:28.960 --> 00:44:41.200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Now, the question here is 364.5 million po was appropriated but only 2.4 million has been utilized.

asr-000580
00:44:41.620 --> 00:44:45.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Bakit parang less than 1% lang po utilization natin?

asr-000581
00:44:47.140 --> 00:44:51.320
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sobra-sobra ho yung binigay sa inyo.

asr-000582
00:44:53.640 --> 00:44:59.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Considering na nababalitaan natin sa mga diaryo naman na may mga nakukulong tayo, mga Pilipino.

asr-000583
00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:03.200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: May mga mamet, tatanungin ko si Secretary,

asr-000584
00:45:03.340 --> 00:45:05.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kumusta na po itong mga kababayan natin?

asr-000585
00:45:05.420 --> 00:45:06.720
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ilan pa po ang nasa detro?

asr-000586
00:45:06.860 --> 00:45:10.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ilan yung na sintensyang habang buhay na pagkabilanggo?

asr-000587
00:45:10.460 --> 00:45:11.620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ilan na po ang nakalabas?

asr-000588
00:45:11.720 --> 00:45:13.080
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano-ano mga bansa po ito?

asr-000589
00:45:13.240 --> 00:45:15.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Please get ready, Secretary Lazaro.

asr-000590
00:45:20.000 --> 00:45:22.120
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000591
00:45:22.120 --> 00:45:25.400
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: For the Legal Assistance Fund specifically,

asr-000592
00:45:25.400 --> 00:45:30.220
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: with now the DMW's Action Fund absorbing most legal cases,

asr-000593
00:45:30.900 --> 00:45:35.360
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: the DMW and MWOs maintain their own legal retainers overseas.

asr-000594
00:45:35.880 --> 00:45:40.740
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: So the bulk of OFW legal cases are now funded through the Action Fund.

asr-000595
00:45:41.220 --> 00:45:45.740
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: We have, however, charged to the Legal Assistance Fund

asr-000596
00:45:45.740 --> 00:45:51.780
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: for 25 cases for 7 OFWs,

asr-000597
00:45:51.780 --> 00:45:54.660
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: or OFs, or Overseas Filipinos,

asr-000598
00:45:54.860 --> 00:45:55.380
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: and for the 2M,

asr-000599
00:45:55.380 --> 00:45:59.980
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: 2026 Legal Assistance Fund,

asr-000600
00:46:00.060 --> 00:46:02.480
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: actually 16 cases of OFs,

asr-000601
00:46:02.740 --> 00:46:08.300
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: mostly in countries na walang MWOs at saka yung status po nila.

asr-000602
00:46:08.640 --> 00:46:10.360
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: They are not OFWs.

asr-000603
00:46:10.360 --> 00:46:15.360
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: They are either tourists, students, migrants,

asr-000604
00:46:16.280 --> 00:46:17.620
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: permanent migrants.

asr-000605
00:46:17.680 --> 00:46:21.000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So yung explanation po ninyo, Yusek Tagu,

asr-000606
00:46:21.780 --> 00:46:25.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ay kasi ang humahawak na ng legal assistance,

asr-000607
00:46:25.380 --> 00:46:27.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ng mga OFWs, ay DMWs.

asr-000608
00:46:28.380 --> 00:46:30.780
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So ano na lang po ang hinahawakan po ninyo?

asr-000609
00:46:30.860 --> 00:46:32.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano po yung tinutulungan ninyo?

asr-000610
00:46:32.880 --> 00:46:36.340
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung wala na po sa inyong office ang mga OFWs,

asr-000611
00:46:36.620 --> 00:46:38.700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: sino-sino na lang po ang mga tinutulungan ninyo?

asr-000612
00:46:39.340 --> 00:46:42.820
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Sir, ang nahawakan namin, ang jurisdiction namin ngayon is

asr-000613
00:46:42.820 --> 00:46:48.880
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: one, tourist, yung mga in-transit doon na nagkaroon ng kaso,

asr-000614
00:46:49.360 --> 00:46:52.580
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: like in-transit or tourist.

asr-000615
00:46:52.580 --> 00:46:54.560
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Yung permanent migrant,

asr-000616
00:46:55.380 --> 00:46:57.760
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: pilgrim, if any.

asr-000617
00:46:58.640 --> 00:47:02.260
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: And ang qualification po is that it would be

asr-000618
00:47:02.260 --> 00:47:05.180
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: unable to engage the services of a council

asr-000619
00:47:05.180 --> 00:47:08.440
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: or in a country without a system of legal aid.

asr-000620
00:47:09.140 --> 00:47:09.540
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Sir?

asr-000621
00:47:10.380 --> 00:47:13.040
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung mga nasa kulungan po,

asr-000622
00:47:13.920 --> 00:47:16.440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: nasa mga bilibit ng iba't-ibang bansa,

asr-000623
00:47:17.120 --> 00:47:18.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: karamihan po dito mga OFW po,

asr-000624
00:47:19.120 --> 00:47:21.820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: hindi naman po sila talagang mga turista lang

asr-000625
00:47:21.820 --> 00:47:25.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: or kundi mga OFWs po,

asr-000626
00:47:25.380 --> 00:47:27.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: hindi naman po sila talagang mga turista lang lalo sa Middle East.

asr-000627
00:47:27.380 --> 00:47:31.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Alright, what about sa Sabah, Malaysia po?

asr-000628
00:47:31.380 --> 00:47:35.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ito po ba yung mga nakakulong doon, yung pinapadeport lagi,

asr-000629
00:47:35.380 --> 00:47:39.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: OFWs po ito, o anong status nila?

asr-000630
00:47:40.380 --> 00:47:42.380
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Sa atin yan.

asr-000631
00:47:42.380 --> 00:47:44.380
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: We consider outreach.

asr-000632
00:47:44.380 --> 00:47:48.380
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: They are the jurisdiction of the DFA,

asr-000633
00:47:48.380 --> 00:47:52.380
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: as long as they are not OFWs there, sir.

asr-000634
00:47:52.380 --> 00:47:54.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, bottom line, na yung natutulungan po ng DFA,

asr-000635
00:47:54.380 --> 00:47:55.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, bottom line, na yung natutulungan po ng DFA,

asr-000636
00:47:55.140 --> 00:48:00.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ay hindi po migrant workers o hindi po OFWs.

asr-000637
00:48:00.140 --> 00:48:03.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero my question now is, paano po,

asr-000638
00:48:03.140 --> 00:48:06.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: sino po ang tutulong doon sa mga babae natin?

asr-000639
00:48:06.140 --> 00:48:07.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Marami rin po po ito.

asr-000640
00:48:07.140 --> 00:48:09.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: And I was once a TNT.

asr-000641
00:48:09.140 --> 00:48:12.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sino po ang tutulong? Paano po matutulungan ito?

asr-000642
00:48:12.140 --> 00:48:16.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: At assistance, anong klaseng assistance binibigay natin dito?

asr-000643
00:48:16.140 --> 00:48:17.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Natago ng tago.

asr-000644
00:48:17.140 --> 00:48:21.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: And would you have numbers right now kung ilan yung mga TNT na sa Middle East,

asr-000645
00:48:21.140 --> 00:48:24.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: na sa US, na sa European Union,

asr-000646
00:48:24.140 --> 00:48:27.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: do we have those figures, sir?

asr-000647
00:48:27.140 --> 00:48:30.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung mga nagturista pero ayaw na umuwi,

asr-000648
00:48:30.140 --> 00:48:32.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: maghanap na ng trabaho doon,

asr-000649
00:48:32.140 --> 00:48:34.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: nagbaba ka sa Cali.

asr-000650
00:48:34.140 --> 00:48:35.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Sir, we do.

asr-000651
00:48:35.140 --> 00:48:38.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: They are, however, estimates.

asr-000652
00:48:38.140 --> 00:48:40.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Part of the report to Congress,

asr-000653
00:48:40.140 --> 00:48:44.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: sinasubmit po ng lahat ng bawat embahada,

asr-000654
00:48:44.140 --> 00:48:49.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: sinasubmit din natin every six months to both houses of Congress,

asr-000655
00:48:49.140 --> 00:48:51.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: is yung report to Congress.

asr-000656
00:48:51.140 --> 00:48:53.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Doon nakalagay yung estimates of permits,

asr-000657
00:48:53.140 --> 00:48:56.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: estimates of permanent migrants, temporary migrants,

asr-000658
00:48:56.140 --> 00:48:58.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: which can include OFW.

asr-000659
00:48:58.140 --> 00:49:02.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: And then the third and final category is undocumented.

asr-000660
00:49:02.140 --> 00:49:07.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Of course, usually, sir, these are estimates ng mga embahada natin.

asr-000661
00:49:07.140 --> 00:49:11.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Hindi sila exact number.

asr-000662
00:49:11.140 --> 00:49:15.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Ang mga mission natin, mga embassies and consulates,

asr-000663
00:49:15.140 --> 00:49:22.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: are ready to extend help to anyone regardless of their residency status sa bansa.

asr-000664
00:49:22.140 --> 00:49:26.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Some, if they don't approach, then we are unable to extend, of course.

asr-000665
00:49:26.140 --> 00:49:36.140
DFA OIC Undersecretary Ezzedin H. Tago: Pero usually, all of them, any Filipino would qualify based on kung nasaan po sila.

asr-000666
00:49:36.140 --> 00:49:38.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: But how do you reach out to these people?

asr-000667
00:49:38.140 --> 00:49:43.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kaya nga po, undocumented, tago ng tago, natatakot po sila lumutang.

asr-000668
00:49:43.140 --> 00:49:47.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Is there a way kaya na you reach out to them?

asr-000669
00:49:47.140 --> 00:49:52.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Or do you use communications sa mga Pilipino na OFW din na,

asr-000670
00:49:52.140 --> 00:49:54.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kachismisan nila doon,

asr-000671
00:49:54.140 --> 00:49:57.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Oye, pwede kang bumihingi ng tulong kahit nawala kang papel?

asr-000672
00:49:57.140 --> 00:49:58.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Usually, ganun po eh.

asr-000673
00:49:58.140 --> 00:50:03.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Na ito, legit nakakapitbahay niya o ka-boarding house siya,

asr-000674
00:50:03.140 --> 00:50:06.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: siya, undocumented, nagkakwentuhan sila.

asr-000675
00:50:06.140 --> 00:50:09.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pinaparating din po ba ninyo na,

asr-000676
00:50:09.140 --> 00:50:13.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Oye, pwede kayo lumapit sa ating DFA?

asr-000677
00:50:13.140 --> 00:50:15.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000678
00:50:15.140 --> 00:50:19.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Kagaya po, yung tungkol po sa tanong ninyo,

asr-000679
00:50:19.140 --> 00:50:21.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: I just want to give a general...

asr-000680
00:50:22.140 --> 00:50:24.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: description.

asr-000681
00:50:24.140 --> 00:50:28.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Out of 10.5 million Filipinos overseas,

asr-000682
00:50:28.140 --> 00:50:30.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: actually, kulang-kulang po...

asr-000683
00:50:30.140 --> 00:50:32.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: 10.5 kasama na po doon ang OFWs?

asr-000684
00:50:32.140 --> 00:50:33.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Opo.

asr-000685
00:50:33.140 --> 00:50:36.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: At 3 million, according to the MW, are OFWs.

asr-000686
00:50:36.140 --> 00:50:39.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Which means, sir, 10.5 minus 3.

asr-000687
00:50:39.140 --> 00:50:42.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Yung natitira nun, nasa jurisdiction namin yun.

asr-000688
00:50:42.140 --> 00:50:45.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Tungkol po doon sa tanong nyo, how do we...

asr-000689
00:50:45.140 --> 00:50:48.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Kagaya po siguro yung mga nangyari sa Amerika recently,

asr-000690
00:50:48.140 --> 00:50:52.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: yung mga actions taken by ICE,

asr-000691
00:50:52.140 --> 00:50:54.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: and many others, ano po yun?

asr-000692
00:50:54.140 --> 00:50:58.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: There is also a number of Filipino community,

asr-000693
00:50:58.140 --> 00:51:01.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: malakas po ang Filipino-American community natin,

asr-000694
00:51:01.140 --> 00:51:03.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: as well as NGOs,

asr-000695
00:51:03.140 --> 00:51:05.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: and we try to...

asr-000696
00:51:05.140 --> 00:51:09.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Our embassy and consulates have their ears on the ground,

asr-000697
00:51:09.140 --> 00:51:13.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: at nalalaman po namin kung may mga nangangailangan na tulong.

asr-000698
00:51:13.140 --> 00:51:15.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: At lumalapit naman po sila,

asr-000699
00:51:15.140 --> 00:51:20.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: because yun po ng pronouncement ng ating mga embassies and consulates na,

asr-000700
00:51:20.140 --> 00:51:23.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: tungkol doon sa problema na yun,

asr-000701
00:51:23.140 --> 00:51:25.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: at kung paano kami makakatulong.

asr-000702
00:51:25.140 --> 00:51:28.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Since we're already talking, Secretary,

asr-000703
00:51:28.140 --> 00:51:31.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: about mga Filipinos overseas, di po ba?

asr-000704
00:51:31.140 --> 00:51:33.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ito po ipadala po ng media.

asr-000705
00:51:33.140 --> 00:51:36.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: These are questions from the media who's watching right now next door,

asr-000706
00:51:36.140 --> 00:51:38.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: doon sa press office nila.

asr-000707
00:51:38.140 --> 00:51:41.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ang question po nila,

asr-000708
00:51:41.140 --> 00:51:47.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: namamonitor din po ba ng DFA yung mga kababayan natin?

asr-000709
00:51:47.140 --> 00:51:49.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Example, Zaldy Co.

asr-000710
00:51:49.140 --> 00:51:51.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Is he still in France?

asr-000711
00:51:51.140 --> 00:51:52.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano po ang status?

asr-000712
00:51:52.140 --> 00:51:54.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Are you monitoring his status?

asr-000713
00:51:54.140 --> 00:51:57.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung nag-apply siya ng asylum?

asr-000714
00:51:57.140 --> 00:51:59.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung pumasa ba ito, nabigyan ba ng asylum?

asr-000715
00:51:59.140 --> 00:52:01.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Does France inform us like,

asr-000716
00:52:01.140 --> 00:52:04.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hoy, isang citizen nyo nag-apply ng asylum.

asr-000717
00:52:04.140 --> 00:52:05.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Can you answer?

asr-000718
00:52:05.140 --> 00:52:07.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Because definitely they will ask us, di ba?

asr-000719
00:52:07.140 --> 00:52:11.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Bakit nag-apply si Zaldy Co ng asylum?

asr-000720
00:52:11.140 --> 00:52:12.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Anything wrong?

asr-000721
00:52:12.140 --> 00:52:14.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I mean, then do you answer?

asr-000722
00:52:14.140 --> 00:52:15.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Secretary Lazaro.

asr-000723
00:52:15.140 --> 00:52:18.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Mr. Chair, ang European Union,

asr-000724
00:52:19.140 --> 00:52:21.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: in France included,

asr-000725
00:52:21.140 --> 00:52:24.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: have very strict privacy issues.

asr-000726
00:52:24.140 --> 00:52:28.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So, kung nag-file man po siya ng asylum,

asr-000727
00:52:28.140 --> 00:52:31.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: hindi po bibigyan, hindi tayo bibigyan na informasyon.

asr-000728
00:52:31.140 --> 00:52:33.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Because this is their law.

asr-000729
00:52:33.140 --> 00:52:34.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: This is their regulation.

asr-000730
00:52:34.140 --> 00:52:36.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So, yun po ang status.

asr-000731
00:52:36.140 --> 00:52:39.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So, maski na po anong tanong ng ating embahada,

asr-000732
00:52:39.140 --> 00:52:41.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: eh hindi po tayo bibigyan na informasyon.

asr-000733
00:52:41.140 --> 00:52:44.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Again, based on their very strict privacy issues.

asr-000734
00:52:44.140 --> 00:52:48.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Ganun din po sa Austria with Harry Roque.

asr-000735
00:52:49.140 --> 00:52:53.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, wala po tayong kung anong status?

asr-000736
00:52:53.140 --> 00:52:58.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi po tayo ini-inform ng host country na isang citizen ninyo?

asr-000737
00:52:58.140 --> 00:52:59.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Hindi po.

asr-000738
00:52:59.140 --> 00:53:08.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Kaya lang po namin na, I think, in the past, nalaman na nasa France si Mr. Co

asr-000739
00:53:08.140 --> 00:53:17.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: because nabanggit sa akin ng Minister of Czech Republic.

asr-000740
00:53:17.140 --> 00:53:20.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Kasi hindi ba siya po yung huling nakita doon.

asr-000741
00:53:20.140 --> 00:53:22.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Sinabi sa akin ng Foreign Minister,

asr-000742
00:53:22.140 --> 00:53:25.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: ah kinuha na nandun na sa France.

asr-000743
00:53:25.140 --> 00:53:28.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Pero ang ganda nung po yung informasyon lamang.

asr-000744
00:53:28.140 --> 00:53:31.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ito po kay Harry Roque.

asr-000745
00:53:31.140 --> 00:53:35.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: The only information we got was like from the DILG.

asr-000746
00:53:35.140 --> 00:53:39.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Wala din po kayong information kung na-deny nga,

asr-000747
00:53:39.140 --> 00:53:46.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: totoo or can you confirm with the France or what country he's in right now?

asr-000748
00:53:46.140 --> 00:53:48.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Netherlands na hindi siya na-

asr-000749
00:53:48.140 --> 00:53:49.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Austria po.

asr-000750
00:53:49.140 --> 00:53:50.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Austria, I'm sorry.

asr-000751
00:53:50.140 --> 00:53:55.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: According to our embassy in Vienna, there is no information at all

asr-000752
00:53:55.140 --> 00:53:59.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: if the asylum has been denied.

asr-000753
00:53:59.140 --> 00:54:04.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Wala pa, again, back to their basic tenets of strict privacy issues.

asr-000754
00:54:04.140 --> 00:54:09.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Is it only in the European Union or what about in other countries?

asr-000755
00:54:09.140 --> 00:54:11.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: South America, ibibigay din po ng asylum.

asr-000756
00:54:11.140 --> 00:54:15.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Are there other countries outside the European Union?

asr-000757
00:54:15.140 --> 00:54:20.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Meron po ba tayo ngayon mga politiko, yung mga hinahanap ng gobyerno

asr-000758
00:54:20.140 --> 00:54:26.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: other than the European Union ay nandoon ngayon sa inyong palagay?

asr-000759
00:54:26.140 --> 00:54:30.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Wala po kaming informasyon pero ang ginagawa po namin, Your Honor,

asr-000760
00:54:30.140 --> 00:54:36.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: is that in many of our bilateral political consultations,

asr-000761
00:54:36.140 --> 00:54:41.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: hinihingi po namin sa mga counterparts namin tatlong bagay.

asr-000762
00:54:41.140 --> 00:54:43.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: And those are agreements.

asr-000763
00:54:43.140 --> 00:54:50.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Extradition, transfer of sentence persons, and mutual legal assistance.

asr-000764
00:54:50.140 --> 00:54:57.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Kung meron tayong itong tatlong agreements na ito sa mga different countries,

asr-000765
00:54:57.140 --> 00:55:00.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: at least I think mas madili po yun.

asr-000766
00:55:00.140 --> 00:55:04.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Pero in these EU countries, wala po tayong itong extradition,

asr-000767
00:55:04.140 --> 00:55:07.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: itong tatlong treaties na ito, agreements.

asr-000768
00:55:07.140 --> 00:55:11.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So yun po siguro ang nagbibigay din ng difficulties.

asr-000769
00:55:11.140 --> 00:55:13.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nag-inspire daw po ba?

asr-000770
00:55:13.140 --> 00:55:15.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ang mga passports na mga ito.

asr-000771
00:55:15.140 --> 00:55:16.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Paano po ito?

asr-000772
00:55:16.140 --> 00:55:20.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kailangan po sila ng batas dito ng mga otoridad.

asr-000773
00:55:20.140 --> 00:55:22.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pwede ba silang mag-renew ng kanilang passport

asr-000774
00:55:22.140 --> 00:55:27.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: or hindi na po i-hold na po ito ng DFA, ng embahada natin?

asr-000775
00:55:27.140 --> 00:55:33.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Siguro po that will be subject to a court order and other agencies

asr-000776
00:55:33.140 --> 00:55:35.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: that will guide us on this.

asr-000777
00:55:35.140 --> 00:55:45.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Pag may warrant of arresto, hindi na namin sila bibigyan ng passport

asr-000778
00:55:45.140 --> 00:55:48.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: or bigyan lang namin sila ng travel document para makauwi.

asr-000779
00:55:48.140 --> 00:55:49.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: One way yun eh.

asr-000780
00:55:49.140 --> 00:55:55.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: From the foreign country to the Philippines, travel document po ang binibigay namin.

asr-000781
00:55:55.140 --> 00:55:59.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: We move to another attached agency.

asr-000782
00:55:59.140 --> 00:56:01.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I have like class 3 questions.

asr-000783
00:56:01.140 --> 00:56:03.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So by the way, Madam Secretary,

asr-000784
00:56:03.140 --> 00:56:07.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kalalabas lang po sa media na isa na naman po before ship po natin

asr-000785
00:56:07.140 --> 00:56:10.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: binangga ng Chinese Coast Guard sa West Philippine Sea.

asr-000786
00:56:10.140 --> 00:56:13.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: You might want to look into this immediately

asr-000787
00:56:13.140 --> 00:56:16.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kung meron po tayong mga casualties or injuries po doon.

asr-000788
00:56:16.140 --> 00:56:20.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Alright. Ito po, isa pa po ito.

asr-000789
00:56:20.140 --> 00:56:29.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Recruitment ng mga Filipinos dyan ngayon sa bakbakan sa Russia and Ukraine.

asr-000790
00:56:29.140 --> 00:56:32.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano ho ang ikanga?

asr-000791
00:56:32.140 --> 00:56:35.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Not only Russia, may mga balita din po po pati sa Ukraine.

asr-000792
00:56:35.140 --> 00:56:41.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung mga may mga experience po na ating mga sundalo po rito,

asr-000793
00:56:41.140 --> 00:56:46.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: mga komando, pumupunta po dito.

asr-000794
00:56:46.140 --> 00:56:50.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ngayon, nahuhuli po sa Russia. May mga nahuli.

asr-000795
00:56:50.140 --> 00:56:55.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So ano ang ginagawa natin dito? Paano ito mamomonitor, Secretary?

asr-000796
00:56:55.140 --> 00:56:59.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Actually, Your Honor, this is really with great difficulty

asr-000797
00:56:59.140 --> 00:57:01.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: pero kasi may mga narinig natin.

asr-000798
00:57:02.140 --> 00:57:07.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: May mga mga, even in the past, hindi lang naman sa kasalukuyan.

asr-000799
00:57:07.140 --> 00:57:11.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: But what we have done is on February 11 this year,

asr-000800
00:57:11.140 --> 00:57:16.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: DFA released an advisory strongly cautioning Filipino nationals

asr-000801
00:57:16.140 --> 00:57:21.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: against accepting overseas employment offers that may involve recruitment.

asr-000802
00:57:21.140 --> 00:57:26.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Usually po nangyayari ito hindi dito eh sa mga third countries like UAE.

asr-000803
00:57:26.140 --> 00:57:30.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Doon po, doon marami tayong mga manggagawa, mga OFWs.

asr-000804
00:57:30.140 --> 00:57:32.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Doon yata po sila nagre-recruit.

asr-000805
00:57:32.140 --> 00:57:37.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: But we have been very, very strict about this and continuous advisory

asr-000806
00:57:37.140 --> 00:57:40.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: from our embassies and consulates.

asr-000807
00:57:40.140 --> 00:57:47.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: We have also made several representations in Manila and in concerned foreign governments

asr-000808
00:57:47.140 --> 00:57:52.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: where repeated requests for communication arrangements with the Filipinos are raised,

asr-000809
00:57:52.140 --> 00:57:55.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: including the possibility of consular access.

asr-000810
00:57:55.140 --> 00:57:58.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Actually po, doon sa tanong ninyo, paano ko nahuli?

asr-000811
00:57:58.140 --> 00:58:01.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Yun po hinihingi namin, consular access.

asr-000812
00:58:01.140 --> 00:58:11.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: May nangyari na po in the past na may nahuli daw ang Ukraine na isang kababayan natin.

asr-000813
00:58:11.140 --> 00:58:18.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So we've been asking our embassy in Warsaw, which has jurisdiction over that area,

asr-000814
00:58:18.140 --> 00:58:23.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: ang hinihingi po ng consular access para malaman namin ano pong nangyari.

asr-000815
00:58:23.140 --> 00:58:27.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Hinihingi namin ang salaysay niya kung paano siya napunta doon,

asr-000816
00:58:27.140 --> 00:58:30.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: kung paano siya napasok doon sa sitwasyon niya na yan.

asr-000817
00:58:30.140 --> 00:58:33.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I believe, narinig ko din po yan.

asr-000818
00:58:33.140 --> 00:58:37.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ang mga experience siya po, security guard po siya dito.

asr-000819
00:58:37.140 --> 00:58:42.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mabuti sana kung may experience siya sa scout ranger natin or special forces

asr-000820
00:58:42.140 --> 00:58:45.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: or special action force dahil well-trained po.

asr-000821
00:58:45.140 --> 00:58:49.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero gayon pa man, malalagay po sa alanganin po sila.

asr-000822
00:58:49.140 --> 00:58:56.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, pamag-a-ganito po ba, have you already informed Russia and Ukraine if ever na may mga Filipinos

asr-000823
00:58:56.140 --> 00:59:01.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: na mga na-recruit o nakapasok sa kanila, sa kanilang military,

asr-000824
00:59:01.140 --> 00:59:05.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: pwedeng ipagbigay sa alam sa inyo? May ganun po ba kayong…

asr-000825
00:59:05.140 --> 00:59:14.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Mr. Chair, we have been making representations pero hindi naman kami nabibigyan ng response.

asr-000826
00:59:14.140 --> 00:59:20.140
