asr-000829
00:59:37.140 --> 00:59:40.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Do they report it to us or to our embassies?

asr-000830
00:59:40.140 --> 00:59:45.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Under the strict observance po sa Vienna Convention on Consular Notification,

asr-000831
00:59:45.140 --> 00:59:52.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: they are bound to always inform yung nationality kung may casualty.

asr-000832
00:59:52.140 --> 00:59:55.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So far naman po dito sa sitwasyon na ito, wala hukin.

asr-000833
00:59:56.140 --> 01:00:00.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: May isa lang po kami palang natanggap na…

asr-000834
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:02.520
