asr-000840
01:00:13.500 --> 01:00:13.780
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Well,

asr-000841
01:00:14.360 --> 01:00:15.920
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: information po, tig-isa.

asr-000842
01:00:16.520 --> 01:00:18.640
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Isa sa Russia, nakakulong. Isa sa Ukraine.

asr-000843
01:00:19.880 --> 01:00:20.520
