asr-000932
01:04:19.080 --> 01:04:22.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I was just concerned.

asr-000933
01:04:22.600 --> 01:04:26.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We received a letter from the APO Production, yung gumagawa ng ating passport, no?

asr-000934
01:04:26.780 --> 01:04:32.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Just recently, kaya ako nag-worry kasi parang it's about the price, no?

asr-000935
01:04:33.320 --> 01:04:41.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That they are saying that the failure to adjust the price, they might be forced to cease their operation

asr-000936
01:04:41.000 --> 01:04:44.560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and baka mamaya wala tayong passport by next year.

asr-000937
01:04:44.560 --> 01:04:48.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, this will be a big problem.

asr-000938
01:04:49.080 --> 01:04:49.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sir Chair, no?

asr-000939
01:04:50.580 --> 01:04:54.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Although, ang inaano kasi na, I think 950 ngayon yung passport.

asr-000940
01:04:55.060 --> 01:04:58.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Tapos, ang reproposed nila is medyo malaki rin kasi, 1-5.

asr-000941
01:04:58.620 --> 01:05:04.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, that will not sit well with OFWs and our other, ano, no?

asr-000942
01:05:04.820 --> 01:05:05.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Medyo malaki.

asr-000943
01:05:05.560 --> 01:05:10.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero meron daw silang discount for seniors and others and OFWs na 1-2 lang.

asr-000944
01:05:10.900 --> 01:05:13.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero anong status na neto?

asr-000945
01:05:13.160 --> 01:05:18.620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Is the DFA taking steps to evaluate, possibly approve the baseline?

asr-000946
01:05:19.080 --> 01:05:22.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Is the DFA taking steps to make adjustments before the year ends para hindi tayo mawala ng passport next year?

asr-000947
01:05:22.440 --> 01:05:24.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yun lang na, concern ko lang, Sir Chair.

asr-000948
01:05:24.460 --> 01:05:24.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you.

asr-000949
01:05:25.580 --> 01:05:26.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Secretary?

asr-000950
