DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000951
01:05:28.820 --> 01:05:30.100
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Gusto ko lang po sagutin.

asr-000952
01:05:30.260 --> 01:05:36.140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Ito pong sulat ng APO is actually a consequence of certain negotiations.

asr-000953
01:05:37.060 --> 01:05:45.580
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Nung sinabi nila na gusto nilang aki-iakyat ang halaga ng passport from the present 952-1500,

asr-000954
01:05:45.820 --> 01:05:47.800
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: ang sabi nyo namin sa kanila, Er,

asr-000955
01:05:47.800 --> 01:05:51.820
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: kung pwede nyo po i-postpone muna ang pag-increase,

asr-000956
01:05:52.260 --> 01:05:56.380
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: acknowledge naman din namin na may talagang, siguro it's about time.

asr-000957
01:05:56.480 --> 01:05:58.740
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Sampuntaon naman kasi yun na hindi nag-increase.

asr-000958
01:05:58.860 --> 01:05:59.240
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Pangalawa?

asr-000959
01:05:59.360 --> 01:06:03.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, the last time was 10 years ago, 2016 pa, increase.

asr-000960
01:06:04.280 --> 01:06:06.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 950 na tayo for the past 10 years.

asr-000961
01:06:06.560 --> 01:06:08.400
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Even more than pang-10 years.

asr-000962
01:06:10.140 --> 01:06:14.520
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Ito kasi ngayon, from 5 years, naging 10 years ang pasaporte.

asr-000963
01:06:14.740 --> 01:06:16.200
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So, medyo talaga kung ano, no?

asr-000964
01:06:16.780 --> 01:06:17.780
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Anyway, back to the question.

asr-000965
01:06:17.800 --> 01:06:23.840
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So, sabi namin, mag-increase na lang kayo pag, sa in-explain namin kay Sen. Tulfo,

asr-000966
01:06:24.140 --> 01:06:31.280
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: magkakaroon ho kami ng new generation passport, which will be launched in 2028, middle.

asr-000967
01:06:32.120 --> 01:06:38.720
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So, ang sabi namin, pero kung may batas eh, which is Philippine Passport Act,

asr-000968
01:06:39.040 --> 01:06:44.220
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: that you cannot increase the price of a passport within 3 years.

asr-000969
01:06:44.220 --> 01:06:47.720
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So, sinaisip po namin, kung mag-i-increase kami, let's say, sa January,

asr-000970
01:06:47.800 --> 01:06:51.520
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: sa nire-request nila, eh, paano ho yun yung next generation?

asr-000971
01:06:51.740 --> 01:06:56.160
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Eh, iba na ho ang papel, iba na ho yung mga, yun lang ang pakiusap namin sa kanila.

asr-000972
01:06:56.300 --> 01:07:00.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, until next year, to hold in abeyance until we have the new generation passports.

asr-000973
01:07:00.400 --> 01:07:01.860
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Until mid-2028.

asr-000974
01:07:02.240 --> 01:07:04.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: By next, I mean, 2028.

asr-000975
01:07:04.100 --> 01:07:04.360
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Opo.

asr-000976
01:07:05.540 --> 01:07:14.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, ang inaano kasi nila, nasa letter na by next year, parang they cannot afford anymore.

asr-000977
01:07:14.380 --> 01:07:17.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Eh, yun lang daw worry ko, baka mamaya mawala tayong passports.

asr-000978
01:07:17.080 --> 01:07:20.080
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Pero, Mr. Chair, kailangan din namin i-convey yan.

asr-000979
01:07:20.420 --> 01:07:22.400
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Magko-communications plan pa kami.

asr-000980
01:07:22.780 --> 01:07:28.100
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Hindi naman basta-basta, maski na po tatlong buwan, kailangan pa rin ho ng enough explanation.

asr-000981
01:07:28.720 --> 01:07:31.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Rob, let us know if there is a need to subsidize.

asr-000982
01:07:31.700 --> 01:07:34.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: You do not want to burden our, ano, no, in-case lang.

asr-000983
01:07:35.520 --> 01:07:39.620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: No, just because medyo masigit din yung fiscal space natin, eh.

asr-000984
01:07:40.080 --> 01:07:44.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: No, we cannot just allocate money kung talagang hindi kailangan, no.

asr-000985
01:07:44.540 --> 01:07:45.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We have a very...

asr-000986
01:07:47.080 --> 01:07:49.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: limited fiscal space this year.

asr-000987
01:07:49.280 --> 01:07:54.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: In fact, nag-a-aisip kami ng mga, ano, measures on how we will be able to trim down the budget.

asr-000988
01:07:54.980 --> 01:07:57.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But, eh, ito kasi, we do not want...

asr-000989
01:07:57.180 --> 01:08:03.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Of course, mga effect on dito, OFWs natin, most specially, no, we do not want them to be burdened

asr-000990
01:08:03.820 --> 01:08:08.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and at the same time be affected by this, ah, this problem.

